  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>For set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</m